++#### Historical / multi-year trends
++
++> ⚠️ **IMPORTANT for band drop/improvement/trend queries**: These require data from **all years** in a single call. Always use `assessment_year=""` (empty — no filter) so all years are returned together. The system will automatically pre-compute the year-over-year movement — do NOT make separate calls for each year.
++
++| Question pattern | `fields` to use | `assessment_year` |
++|---|---|---|
++| "ratings dropped" / "band dropped" / "2 band drop" / "dropped 2 bands" | `emp_name,category_band,band_numeric,separation_status` | `""` (all years) |
++| "ratings improved" / "band improved" / "went up 2 bands" | `emp_name,category_band,band_numeric,separation_status` | `""` (all years) |
++| "year over year" / "yoy" / "compared to previous year" / "band trend" / "band movement" | `emp_name,category_band,band_numeric,separation_status` | `""` (all years) |
++| "rating trends over last 3 years" / "FY25, FY24, FY23 bands" | `emp_name,category_band,band_numeric,manager_validated_final_kra_score` | `""` (all years) |
++| "consistent EC/SC for 3 cycles" | `emp_name,category_band,band_numeric` | `""` (all years) |
++
