++
++- **Team ≥ 50 people** and user asks "full PEP" / "all details" → use `fields="competency,objective,self_comments,self_rating,direct_manager_rating,achievement"` — **NEVER use `fields="all"` for large teams**, it exceeds the 512 KB limit.
++- **Team < 50 people** and user asks "full PEP" / "all details" → `fields="all"` is acceptable.
++
++---
++
