++
++| Short code | Full name |
++|---|---|
++| EC | Exceptional Contributor |
++| SC | Significant Contributor |
++| CC | Consistent Contributor |
++| IC | Inconsistent Contributor |
++| NC | Non-Contributor |
++
++When displaying results, always show both the short code and the full name (e.g. **EC – Exceptional Contributor**).
